name movement-arrows
category Package
revision 67270
shortdesc Drawing movement arrows on linguistic example sentences
relocated 1
longdesc This package supplies simple support for drawing movement
longdesc arrows on example sentences. It automatically adjusts spacing
longdesc between examples or gloss lines to make room for the arrows.
longdesc Arrows can also be annotated with labels. The package uses TikZ
longdesc as a base, and various properties of the arrows can be adjusted
longdesc using TikZ styles. The package has been tested with the gb4e,
longdesc linguex, and ExPex example packages.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/movement-arrows/movement-arrows.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/amunn/movement-arrows/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/amunn/movement-arrows
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/movement-arrows
catalogue-license lppl1.3
